      "answer": "C",
      "answer_index": 2,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{设所需材料的近似值与精确值分别为}\\tilde{T},T, \\text{则} \\\\\\tilde{T} \\approx \\left| d u \\right| = \\left| d(xyz) \\right| = \\left| yz \\Delta x + xz \\Delta y + xy \\Delta z \\right|. \\text{把} x=5,y=4,z=3, \\Delta x=\\Delta y=-0.4, \\Delta z=-0.2 \\text{代入得} \\tilde{T} \\approx 14.8\\left( m^{3} \\right), \\text{而} \\ T=5 \\times 4 \\times 3-4.6 \\times 3.6 \\times 2.8=13.632(m^{3}), \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{设所需材料的近似值与精确值分别为}\\tilde{T},T, \\text{则} \\\\\\tilde{T} \\approx \\left| d u \\right| = \\left| d(xyz) \\right| = \\left| yz \\Delta x + xz \\Delta y + xy \\Delta z \\right|. \\text{把} x=5,y=4,z=3, \\Delta x=\\Delta y=-0.4, \\Delta z=-0.2 \\text{代入得} \\tilde{T} \\approx 14.8\\left( m^{3} \\right), \\text{而} \\ T=5 \\times 4 \\times 3-4.6 \\times 3.6 \\times 2.8=13.632(m^{3}), \\end{aligned}</div>"
