      "answer": "B",
      "answer_index": 1,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp; \\text{记对角线为}z\\text{，则}z=\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}\\text{, }\\\\&amp;\\quad\\Delta z\\approx dz=f_{x}(x,y)\\Delta x+f_{y}(x,y)\\Delta y=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}}dx+\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}}dy\\text{, }\\\\&amp;\\text{当}x=6,y=8,\\Delta x=0.02,\\Delta y=-0.05\\text{时, }\\\\&amp;\\quad\\Delta z=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6^{2}+8^{2}}}\\big[6\\times 0.02+8\\times(-0.05)\\big]=\\frac{1}{10}(0.12-0.4)=-0.028\\text{。}\\\\&amp;\\text{可见对角线约减少了}2.8\\,\\text{cm。}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp; \\text{记对角线为}z\\text{，则}z=\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}\\text{, }\\\\&amp;\\quad\\Delta z\\approx dz=f_{x}(x,y)\\Delta x+f_{y}(x,y)\\Delta y=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}}dx+\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}}dy\\text{, }\\\\&amp;\\text{当}x=6,y=8,\\Delta x=0.02,\\Delta y=-0.05\\text{时, }\\\\&amp;\\quad\\Delta z=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6^{2}+8^{2}}}\\big[6\\times 0.02+8\\times(-0.05)\\big]=\\frac{1}{10}(0.12-0.4)=-0.028\\text{。}\\\\&amp;\\text{可见对角线约减少了}2.8\\,\\text{cm。}\\end{aligned}</div>"
